          { t: '能見度：頂點距離是什麼？高度數配眼鏡為什麼要算它（頂點距離換算）', u: '/blog/vertex-distance/' },
          { t: '能見度：鏡框品牌（經銷名單與精品鏡架非代理說明）', u: '/frames/' },
          { t: '驗光人員法（全國法規資料庫）', u: 'https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?PCode=L0020190' },
        ].map(r => (
          <li class="text-brand-ink-2"><a href={r.u} target={r.u.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : undefined} rel={r.u.startsWith('http') ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined} class="hover:text-brand-gold underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2">{r.t}</a></li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <p class="text-brand-ink-2" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8">52□18-140 的標法依 ISO 8624，鯖江的產地背景引自福井縣眼鏡協會。蒙耐爾含鎳，是合金本身的成分。經銷哪 12 個品牌、MINAMOTO 源放在哪一間、兩店能做哪些調整與維修，由能見度門市確認後寫進本頁；框能不能做，以現場評估為準。最後更新：2026 年 10 月 23 日。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 聚落文章：讀分類表 frames 全部小分類（13 篇），依小分類分組（分組名用 <p>，不佔標題層級）；另加分類外延伸卡 -->
  <section id="cluster" class="px-6 md:px-16 py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-brand-ink mb-10" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);font-weight:400">鏡框怎麼挑主題文章</h2>
      {clusterGroups.map(g => (
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-ink-3 tracking-widest uppercase mb-5" style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.18em">{g.name}</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            {g.posts.map(post => (
              <a href={`/blog/${post!.slug}/`} class="rounded-2xl p-7 border border-brand-ink/10 hover:border-brand-gold transition-colors group" style="background:#f7f3ec">
                <span class="bg-brand-light text-brand-navy text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">{post!.data.tag}</span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-brand-navy mt-4 mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5">{post!.data.title}</h3>
                <p class="text-brand-ink-3 line-clamp-2" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7">{post!.data.excerpt}</p>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
      <div>
        <p class="font-sans text-brand-ink-3 tracking-widest uppercase mb-5" style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.18em">兒童鏡框、舊框換片與自帶框</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          {extraPosts.map(post => (
            <a href={`/blog/${post!.slug}/`} class="rounded-2xl p-7 border border-brand-gold/40 hover:border-brand-gold transition-colors group" style="background:#eee8da">
              <span class="bg-brand-light text-brand-navy text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">{post!.data.tag}</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-brand-navy mt-4 mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5">{post!.data.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-brand-ink-3 line-clamp-2" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7">{post!.data.excerpt}</p>
            </a>
          ))}
          <a href={BYO_GUIDE} class="rounded-2xl p-7 border border-brand-gold/40 hover:border-brand-gold transition-colors group" style="background:#eee8da">
            <span class="bg-brand-gold text-brand-navy text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">完整指南</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-brand-navy mt-4 mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5">{GUIDE_TITLES[BYO_GUIDE]}</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-ink-3 line-clamp-2" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7">網購的框、舊框、精品框帶來配鏡片：加工費怎麼算、動工前先看什麼。</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/topics/frames/" class="inline-block mt-8 font-sans text-brand-gold hover:text-brand-navy transition-colors" style="font-size:15px">依主題看鏡框全部文章 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA（按鈕改「預約視覺諮詢」#30；刪「不是把最貴的推給你」#32） -->
  <section class="px-6 py-20" style="background:#1a2f4e">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-white mb-4" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,34px);font-weight:300">伸手拿框之前，先量合不合臉</h2>
      <p class="text-white/60 mb-8" style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8">尺寸、鼻樑和這次要配的鏡片先對過一輪，鏡框牆前剩下的那一排，再照你的喜好慢慢試。新莊、板橋兩店都接預約；想試戴 MINAMOTO 源，請約新莊店。</p>
      <a href="/booking/" class="inline-block bg-brand-gold text-brand-navy font-bold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full hover:bg-brand-gold/90 transition-colors font-sans" style="font-size:15px">預約視覺諮詢 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 延伸閱讀：指南聚落互連（法務 🟢 純導覽） -->
  <section class="px-6 md:px-16 py-14 border-t border-brand-ink/10" style="background:#eee8da">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <span class="font-sans text-brand-ink-3 tracking-widest uppercase block mb-6" style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.18em">延伸閱讀｜其他完整指南</span>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {[
          { href: '/guide/lens-brands/', t: '鏡片選購完整指南' },
          { href: '/guide/high-myopia/', t: '高度近視配鏡完整指南' },
          { href: '/guide/choose-optician/', t: '新北配眼鏡完整指南' },
        ].map(g => (
          <a href={g.href} class="block bg-brand-paper border border-brand-ink/10 px-5 py-4 hover:border-brand-gold transition-colors font-serif text-brand-navy" style="font-size:16px;font-weight:400">{g.t} →</a>
        ))}
      </div>
      <a href="/blog/" class="inline-block mt-6 font-sans text-brand-gold hover:text-brand-navy transition-colors" style="font-size:14px">← 回配鏡知識</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
